<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-02T07:51:33.769Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:51:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed is sending senior ministers to military training in Hurso while Ethiopian drones are striking targets in Sudan, an Amhara displacement camp and civilians gathering grain in Tigray. Sudan accuses Ethiopia of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones and of supplying arms to the RSF. An RPG fired near a school in Moyale killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers, prompting the Orthodox Church to demand action, and the conflict has displaced 1.7 million Ethiopians with an additional 173,000 affected by disasters, according to UNHCR. There were 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOcWZNaEhDNTUzQnM0bHItQUlLX1ZxT3h6N3hqWGJLV3p3T2o2NHRnZTZGcDg4bG5OOEE5N0pFNHVHWGNTSHljNS1nVVY5ajNkTVpWV1R3RXFuLS1tYlhjRzNJbmNvYUVyNF9xWDhlYkZGMWNSU3Q5bUxFakRtcFVyaHBKQmo2ekJM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNYmtEOElTOGQ0ZmdmZ01CakJ6YnRUWTQ5T0M4cHltdUdCSlFBYXhUbVdvODJJbmJWUVUza19wYVJQNUlvUmlMV3NwWFQtclFMcnVpUFZZaEVhNXhxZ3dPZjZENUdQYWZoUkdkUHczOUxzYzE3d1lVVmVXVlZYMFpDNy1STk5iSktqcTc0MUpyLWpxM2VGbTlGYng2ZTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Other Cheek&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1nQzM4MG9nazg2UWxDUDdyMG11ck9ta2toYklXOUIxWGlLTVp5cUZVSzI4TkdwSUQ5MndtdmFmRmozSFdPaWVVRWo1RXNEeTkyN1VnWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Reporter Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNeWR2Nm